    "detailed_description": "A woman is trapped inside the basement and your job is to...<br><br>Get the password.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/cb28964d502a4c9983d038dd8bf99d0e.poster.avif?t=1744745231\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/cb28964d502a4c9983d038dd8bf99d0e.webm?t=1744745231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/cb28964d502a4c9983d038dd8bf99d0e.mp4?t=1744745231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Martyrdom is a psychological horror game, where you torture a person to get the password, using various methods, but nothing seems to be working. You don't have much time as a creature - Alastor - is lurking in the building as well and it's getting closer and closer to you. Explore the unique apartment with surreal puzzles and environment, and get the password.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/3c4afe19c9c2645c5cc8cab2099ec70f.poster.avif?t=1744745231\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/3c4afe19c9c2645c5cc8cab2099ec70f.webm?t=1744745231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/3c4afe19c9c2645c5cc8cab2099ec70f.mp4?t=1744745231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The surrealism and torture is being combined to achieve unique, dark and creepy story-telling as well as visual environment, with more and more creatures showing up to torture you, as well as offer new gameplay and puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/32b8b757a5d945238d0130297e8e1220.poster.avif?t=1744745231\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/32b8b757a5d945238d0130297e8e1220.webm?t=1744745231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786310/extras/32b8b757a5d945238d0130297e8e1220.mp4?t=1744745231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
